# LF in the repository, always.
#
# `.editorconfig` already says `end_of_line = lf`, but an editorconfig is advice to
# editors — it does not bind a script that writes a file, and several tools on Windows
# default to CRLF. That mismatch produced whole-file diffs where two lines had changed,
# which makes review useless exactly when it matters most.
#
# This binds it at the repository instead of asking every tool to behave.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.7z binary
